      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Rerolls offered items from\nshops, armories and boss rewards.",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/level2",
        "locator": "MonoBehaviour:3755/UI.Menus.Inventory.DiceButton/description"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Welcome young traveller!\nI am here to help you\nget going on your journey.",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:12114"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "You can dash, with ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:12320"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": ".\nWhile dashing, you are\ninvincible.\nDashing costs 1 ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:1574"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "MASTERY SYSTEM",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:7341"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "After each run you gain mastery <color=yellow>EXP</color> depending on how many bosses you have defeated.\nPer level you can allocate one perk.\nThese perks are ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:2709"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "not required",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:15745"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": " to succeed on your journey but they surely help.\nUnlock and activate ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:587"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": " modifiers to level up faster.",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:528"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Mastery\n{0}/30",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:7453"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\n•Attack Damage: ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:141"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\n•Attack Speed: ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:142"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\n•Damage Scaling: ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:144"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\n•Weapon Range: ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:157"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\n•Weapon Type: ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:158"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "<ArrowWhite>Check Details",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:1994"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Haha!\nYou're a natural.\nLet's meet in the next room.",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:6119"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": ", open\nyour ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:1424"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Drag and drop, or right-click",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:4946"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Time for a real battle.\nWe shall meet again\nin the next room!",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:11066"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Splendid!\nNow attack the target dummy\nwith ",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:9732"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Food will grant <color=yellow>EXP</color>.\nYou need <color=yellow>EXP</color> to level up\nand learn new Traits.",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:5746"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "CURSE",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:3427"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "It seems you have been Cursed",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:7007"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Yummy, yummy souls<sprite name=\"Soul\">.\nOh! You are still here, aren't you?",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:12363",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Got any souls<sprite name=\"Soul\">?",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:6014",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Don't rely on luck.\nBring me souls<sprite name=\"Soul\">.",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:4929",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "Weapons gain [[x{0:0.00}]]\nDamage per Upgrade Level.",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:12107",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "All Lightning Damage\ninflicts Shock.",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:2734",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\n2-Set: ",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:75",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
        "sourceText": "\nAttunement: {0}/{1}",
        "locator": "StringLiteral:92",
        "resourcePath": "Tiny Rogues_Data/il2cpp_data/Metadata/global-metadata.dat"
      },
      {
